# Keep the build context minimal and never ship secrets, VCS data or host artefacts.
.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/storybook-static
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.local
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
design-system-screenshots
docs
tools
.superpowers
.claude
.vscode
